# This repo is public and exists only to host the builder on GitHub Pages.
# Everything in the working folder is ignored by default; the files that get
# published are whitelisted below. Draft rules, model analyses and scratch
# files stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!index.html
!mech_calculator_v2.html

# Tabletop Simulator mod: sources + generated PNGs (served by GitHub Pages —
# TTS loads card/template images from this repo's Pages site).
!tts/
!tts/**
tts/build/
# The full rules stay local by design (like the rules markdown above) —
# un-ignore deliberately if the rulebook PDF should ship to multiplayer guests.
tts/assets/png/*/rules.pdf
